>>
Rule 1 (tensor should not be empty)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ∀i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) > 0
>>
Rule 2 (dimension index must be within valid range)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= 0 ≤ v_2 ∧ v_2 < ndim(v_1)
>>
Rule 4 (tensor should have at least one dimension)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0
>>
Rule 5 (tensor should not be scalar)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 1
>>
Rule 7 (tensor should not have zero-length dimension)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= shape(v_1, v_2) > 0
>>
Rule 10 (tensor must be valid for unbind operation)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) > 0 ∧ shape(v_1, 0) > 0
